dc and a wave by type alters
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource type="dc" dc=-6 val0=0 val1=1 rise=1u fall=1u width=1u period=4u
v2 (b 0) vsource dc=2 val0=1
v3 (c 0) vsource type="sine" ampl=1
control
  analysis op1 op
  alter instance("v1") type="pulse"
  analysis tr1 tran stop=6u step=10n
  alter instance("v1") type="dc"
  analysis op2 op
  alter instance("v3") type="dc"
  analysis op3 op
endc
